sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Student
    participant A as App
    participant V as Vocab extractor
    participant T as Summary template
    participant L as LLM (optional)
    participant DB as IndexedDB
    participant P as Print / screen

    Note over S,P: End of class — the terminal artifact

    S->>A: "End class"
    A->>V: segments + flagged spans + gaps
    V-->>A: key terms, TL/EN pairs,<br/>flagged + noisy spans

    A->>T: structured facts only
    T-->>A: deterministic summary<br/><b>always works, even if everything else fails</b>

    opt LLM enabled (cut #1 — likely absent)
        A->>L: prose request around injected facts
        L-->>A: draft — never a number
        A->>A: verify every figure came from facts<br/>reject any invented value
    end

    A->>DB: persist session + coverage stats
    A->>DB: confirm incremental writes landed
    A-->>P: print layout — adjustable type size + contrast
    Note over P: If printing unavailable (phone),<br/>the sheet stays fully readable on-screen

    Note over S,P: Student walks away with paper.<br/>That is the point of the whole product.
